# Backend stack colocated under stack/ (moved here 2026-08-06). Each is its own
# upstream checkout (GPT-SoVITS, Applio, ActionPlan-Code, world-perception), so
# they stay out of this repo rather than becoming embedded repos / submodules.
/stack/

# TRELLIS.2 upstream checkout vendored under the trellis-service sidecar.
# It carries its own .git (~820MB incl. submodules); the service wrapper
# (trellis_service.py / trellis_runner.py / install_trellis.sh) is tracked, the
# upstream tree is not. Re-create it with scripts/setup-trellis.ts.
/trellis-service/TRELLIS.2/

